 strategy, and community outreach.","order",6,"ogImageUrl","https://htduck.github.io/irg-donor-impact-plan/media/public-relations-outdoor-team/public-relations-outdoor-team-1204.jpg","publish",true,"shortTitle","tagline","Transparency through communication, across all teams.","https://htduck.github.io/irg-donor-impact-plan/sections/aviation/","Aviation Section","Coordinated aerial operations, UAS missions, and manned aircraft support.",5,"https://htduck.github.io/irg-donor-impact-plan/media/aviation-helicopter-equipment-transfer/aviation-helicopter-equipment-transfer-1244.jpg","Reaching what ground teams cannot.","https://htduck.github.io/irg-donor-impact-plan/sections/logistics/","Logistics Section","Supply chain management, transport coordination, and coalition integration.",4,"https://htduck.github.io/irg-donor-impact-plan/media/logistics-aircraft-supply-transfer/logistics-aircraft-supply-transfer-1244.jpg","Good intentions fail without logistics—we ensure their success.","https://htduck.github.io/irg-donor-impact-plan/sections/medical/","Medical Section","Forward triage, field trauma care, and coordination with first responders.",3,"https://htduck.github.io/irg-donor-impact-plan/media/medical-responder-interaction/medical-responder-interaction-950.jpg","Field medicine in affected areas.","https://htduck.github.io/irg-donor-impact-plan/sections/crisis-intelligence-management/","Crisis Intelligence Management Section","Rapid needs assessments, GIS mapping, and situation reporting.",2,"https://htduck.github.io/irg-donor-impact-plan/media/crisis-intelligence-damaged-homes/crisis-intelligence-damaged-homes-1184.jpg","Turning chaos into actionable data.","https://htduck.github.io/irg-donor-impact-plan/sections/command-and-control/","Command & Control Section","Satellite comms, digital command infrastructure, and real-time situational awareness.",1,"https://htduck.github.io/irg-donor-impact-plan/media/command-control-operational-briefing/command-control-operational-briefing-1280.jpg","The nervous system of every IRG deployment.","https://htduck.github.io/irg-donor-impact-plan/sections/","Operational Sections | Integrated Response Group","Command and Control, Crisis Intelligence Management, Medical, Logistics, Aviation, and Public Relations.","https://htduck.github.io/irg-donor-impact-plan/media/default-og.jpg","bodyHtml","<h2>Our Six Operational Sections</h2>",[229],{"_59":230,"_231":232,"_233":234},"our-six-operational-sections","heading","Our Six Operational Sections","html",""]
